Package: goodix550c-fingerprint
Version: 1.1.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Local goodix550c build <noreply@localhost>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: libfprint-goodix550c (>= 3), fprintd, libpam-fprintd, udev, python3, python3-textual (>= 2.1), python3-rich
Recommends: tlp
Conflicts: finger
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/the-great-king-bart/goodix-550c-linux-driver
Description: configuration and tooling for the Goodix 27c6:550c fingerprint sensor
 Drop-in for fprintd (driver allow-list, runtime gates, PSK file path),
 udev rule keeping USB autosuspend off for the sensor, TLP denylist, an apt
 pin for the patched libfprint-2-2, an opt-in pam-auth-update profile and the
 goodix550c-ctl helper, plus the full-screen
 "finger" terminal app (alias goodix550c-tui) for enrolling and testing fingers.
 .
 The pre-shared key is NOT part of this package: install it with
 "goodix550c-ctl install-psk FILE". The PAM profile is not enabled
 automatically: "goodix550c-ctl pam enable".
